{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_1000_place", "source_sha256": "969d81a6cf4343f2af46f95f525b53027565814e8a36f33a1e945bfe39b85733", "ja": "ラジオ収録スタジオ", "zh": "广播录音室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_1001_037nao", "source_sha256": "b746f9d8eeb23c74dd58621ccdf858d9696aca3f2b863276bc0286f03d065e88", "ja": "ふう～、やっとCMになった～。\nラジオのお仕事って、むっちゃ緊張するなー。", "zh": "呼～终于到广告时间了～\n广播的工作真令人紧张呀──", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_1002_037nao", "source_sha256": "369697c03442c099c930fa4dea3620833b435e5d9f02061e638eb0cc7dbe152a", "ja": "噛んでも、録り直しとかできひんし……。\nせやけど、いっぱい喋れて、めっちゃ楽しいわ！", "zh": "就算吃螺丝也不能重录……\n但是可以说很多话，超开心的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_1003_p", "source_sha256": "5b70732afc27999c0d8d90167d25ecaebad2d9a1a71634992b16ce4334cfa1d5", "ja": "うん、今のところ、いい感じだぞ。\nCM明けも、その調子で頑張ってくれ。", "zh": "嗯，目前感觉很不错喔。\n广告结束后，也照这步调继续加油吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_1004_037nao", "source_sha256": "2bc95a1a0d9035cfd7662b695c0c9aac5b0fe72e3532211c4a9ffa3d83a5719e", "ja": "{$P$}さんも、ラジオのお仕事、\n私に向いてると思いません？　ふふふ♪", "zh": "{$P$}先生，你不觉得\n广播的工作很适合我吗？呵呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_037nao_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_037nao_1005_037nao", "source_sha256": "c3ef1e3c144913cdb6f575724884e459bb6220776245be9784f06527739aab37", "ja": "あっ、もう時間や！\n放送が終わるまで、全力で行っくで～！", "zh": "啊，时间到了！\n我会尽全力录完节目的嘿～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
